---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Size Guide — AASRA" description="Measurements and fitting guide.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:640px;">
      <h1>Size Guide</h1>
      <p>Measurements are approximate and listed on each product page. All dimensions in cm/inches.</p>
      <h3>Curtain panels</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Width: measure your window width and add 15–25 cm on each side for fullness.</li>
        <li>Drop: measure from the rod to where you want the curtain to end (sill, floor, or puddle).</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>Rugs</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Living room: front legs of furniture should sit on the rug.</li>
        <li>Dining: rug should extend 60 cm beyond the table on all sides.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Contact us if you need help choosing a size.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
